[Quotes]
victory1 = "You're still not good enough." ;
victory2 = "Let's leave it at that for today." ;
victory3 = "'Let's leave it at that for today' is something you say when you win, not when running away, you know?" ;
victory4 = "The way I speak is a habit of mine. I don't believe I'm particularly old." ;
victory5 = "I once had enough power to hold sway over a third of Japan's tanuki, but perhaps that's a thing of the past, now." ;
victory6 = "Er, hmm, I suppose that will do." ;
;;Victory vs Reimu
victory7 = "Leaf money is convenient, no? You can use them for donation money or anything." ;
victory8 = "It's easy to transform into you. You're already tanuki-like." ;
;;Victory vs Marisa
victory9 = "There are lots of magicians in the outside world too." ;
victory10 = "You caught some tanuki recently, didn't you. Are you making tanuki hot pot?" ;
;;Victory vs Sanae
victory11 = "Ho! Ho! Ho! How long will you keep that confidence?" ;
victory12 = "My, aren't you an odd one?" ;
;;Victory vs Ichirin Kumoi
victory13 = "You're weak because you don't eat meat." ;
victory14 = "It's not easy to transform into a nyuudou." ;
;;Victory vs Yukari
victory15 = "You were the one spreading around those doomsday rumors a while back. That's a bit of a coincidence, don'cha think?" ;
victory16 = "Hohoho, I guess only one of us is truly young after all." ;
;;Victory vs Koishi
victory17 = "A satori...huh. It won't be easy to transform into you." ;
victory18 = "A satori who can't read minds is like a tanuki who can't transform into a human." ;
;;Victory vs Mokou
victory19 = "Nevertheless... Immortality’s nothing but a load’a hogwash." ;
victory20 = "'Cause the bamboo forest’s the rabbits’ turf, I ain’t very fond of it." ;
;;Victory vs Reisen/Tewi
victory21 = "I hate rabbits."
victory22 = "Beasts who cannot transform have no future."